OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering two
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers and US
OL,5,Afriend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have been found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurdering Australian brothers Jake and
OL,9,FCallum Robinson, and their US friend
OL,10,FCarter Rhoad during a surfing trip in
OL,11,FMexico in 2024.
OL,13,FJesus Gerardo, Irineo Francisco and
OL,14,FAngel Jesus are yet to be sentenced -
OL,15,Fbut they are likely to spend the rest
OL,16,Fof their lives in a Mexican prison.
OL,18,FDebra Robinson, the brother's mother,
OL,19,Ftold the courtroom in the northern Baja
OL,20,FCalifornia state the murders of her
OL,21,Fsons had taken "the future we had
OL,22,Fimagined with them".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
