OL,3,AThree men found guilty of murdering two
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers and US
OL,5,Afriend
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring the trial the court heard the
OL,8,Ftourists were killed in an apparent
OL,9,Fbotched robbery of their truck in a
OL,10,Fsecluded beach area. Their bodies were
OL,11,Flater found with gunshot wounds to
OL,12,Ftheir heads, dumped down a well.
